<main class="landing">
  <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
    <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Tech Tools home">
      <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">&lt;/&gt;</span>
      <span>tech<span class="brand-light">tools</span></span>
    </a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#stack">The stack</a>
      <a href="https://guides.rubyonrails.org/">Rails guides <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
    <a class="nav-cta" href="/up">App status <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </nav>

  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> YOUR NEXT IDEA STARTS HERE</p>
      <h1 id="hero-title">A solid start.<br><span>Room to build.</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-description">
        Your Rails workspace is ready. The essentials are in place, so you can spend
        less time on setup and more time making something useful.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button button-primary" href="#stack">Explore your starter <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
        <a class="text-link" href="https://guides.rubyonrails.org/getting_started.html">Read the getting started guide <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-note">
        <span class="note-icon" aria-hidden="true">✳</span>
        <span>Built with Rails 8.1 <span class="note-separator">·</span> Ready for your first commit</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="terminal-card" aria-label="Example Rails development commands">
      <div class="terminal-top">
        <div class="window-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
        <span class="terminal-label">YOUR TERMINAL</span>
        <span class="terminal-ready"><span class="status-dot"></span> READY</span>
      </div>
      <div class="terminal-body">
        <p class="terminal-comment"># Get your app running</p>
        <p><span class="prompt">$</span> bin/setup --skip-server</p>
        <p><span class="prompt">$</span> bin/dev</p>
        <div class="terminal-divider"></div>
        <p class="terminal-comment"># Then make it yours</p>
        <p><span class="prompt">$</span> bin/rails generate</p>
        <p class="terminal-output">Your next feature starts here<span class="cursor" aria-hidden="true"></span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="terminal-footer"><span class="terminal-spark" aria-hidden="true">✳</span> Everything you need. Nothing you don't.</div>
    </div>
    <span class="hero-orbit orbit-one" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="hero-orbit orbit-two" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  </section>

  <section class="stack-section" id="stack" aria-labelledby="stack-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">THE FOUNDATION</p>
        <h2 id="stack-title">A familiar stack, thoughtfully set up.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="section-description">A few dependable building blocks to help you move from blank page to first release.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="stack-grid">
      <article class="stack-card">
        <span class="card-icon rails-icon" aria-hidden="true">R</span>
        <div class="card-content">
          <div class="card-heading"><h3>Ruby on Rails</h3><span class="card-version">8.1</span></div>
          <p>A productive framework with sensible defaults and a clear path from idea to application.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </article>
      <article class="stack-card">
        <span class="card-icon hotwire-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌁</span>
        <div class="card-content">
          <div class="card-heading"><h3>Hotwire</h3><span class="card-version">Turbo + Stimulus</span></div>
          <p>Fast, interactive experiences with HTML-first tools and just the JavaScript you need.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </article>
      <article class="stack-card">
        <span class="card-icon sqlite-icon" aria-hidden="true">▤</span>
        <div class="card-content">
          <div class="card-heading"><h3>SQLite</h3><span class="card-version">Ready to go</span></div>
          <p>A lightweight database for local development, configured and waiting for your models.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <a class="brand footer-brand" href="/" aria-label="Tech Tools home">
